<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Lesson 10 - Practice</title>
</head>

<body>
<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
font-family:Arial;
background:#eee;
}

.wrapper{
display:flex;
background:#444;
padding:20px;
max-width:1000px;
margin:auto;
}



.tabs{
width:120px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
}

.tab{
background:#777;
color:white;
padding:15px;
margin-bottom:5px;
cursor:pointer;
}

.tab:hover{
background:#555;
}

.tab:first-child{
background:#555;
}


.content{
display:flex;
gap:20px;
padding-left:20px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.block{
width:350px;
color:white;
}

.block img{
width:100%;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.block h3{
margin-bottom:10px;
}

</style>

<div class="wrapper">

<div class="tabs">
<div class="tab">Tab 1</div>
<div class="tab">Tab 2</div>
<div class="tab">Tab 3</div>
</div>

<div class="content">

<div class="block">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/350x220">
<h3>Header 1</h3>
<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. In ultrices lorem id consectetur tempor.</p>
</div>

<div class="block">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/350x220">
<h3>Header 2</h3>
<p>Quisque id lectus et ipsum bibendum mattis vitae sagittis magna.</p>
</div>

<div class="block">
<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/350x220">
<h3>Header 3</h3>
<p>Mauris nec purus nec ligula euismod convallis.</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
